    "unit_id": "U31",
    "rule": "Three phrases to keep a conversation going. Non capisco means I don't understand. Più lentamente, or più piano, asks for slower speech. Ripeti asks a friend to say it again, and ripeta asks politely. Parla is for someone you call tu and parli for someone you call Lei. Per favore makes each one polite.",
