    "unit_id": "U32",
    "rule": "Two questions for words you don't know. Come si dice…? asks how something is said: Come si dice questo in italiano? Cosa significa…? and Cosa vuol dire…? both ask what a word means. Che, cosa and che cosa all mean what, and any of the three can start the question.",
