    "unit_id": "U07",
    "rule": "An adjective agrees with its noun: buono, nuovo, vecchio and bello with a masculine noun, buona, nuova, vecchia and bella with a feminine one. Giovane doesn't change. Most adjectives come after the noun (una macchina vecchia), though a few common ones can come before it. Molto before an adjective means very; after a verb it means a lot. Anche means also and comes before the word it adds.",
