    "conjugations": []
  },
  {
    "unit_id": "U12",
    "rule": "The numbers from one to ten don't change with the noun, except uno, which becomes un or una before one. Sei, six, is spelled like sei, you are. How many is quanti with a masculine plural (quanti libri) and quante with a feminine one (quante mele).",
    "example_sentence_ids": "S12003;S12004;S12017",
