    "rule": "A colour comes after its noun and agrees with it: rosso, nero, bianco and giallo with a masculine noun, rossa, nera, bianca and gialla with a feminine one. Verde stays the same for both, and blu never changes at all. Che colore è? asks what colour something is.",
