    "unit_id": "U42",
    "rule": "Numbers from 11 to 20: undici, dodici, tredici, quattordici, quindici, sedici, diciassette, diciotto, diciannove, venti. Sei is six, and also you are: the sentence makes it clear. Phone numbers are said in pairs or one digit at a time, with zero for 0.",
