  {
    "unit_id": "U43",
    "rule": "Italian uses avere for age: Ho venti anni (I am twenty, literally I have twenty years). To ask, say Quanti anni hai? Sono nato (a man) and sono nata (a woman) mean I was born. Buon compleanno! is happy birthday.",
