  {
    "unit_id": "U35",
    "rule": "Ways to check a number or ask for time: Un momento (one moment), Aspetta (wait), È giusto? (is that right?), and Certo! (of course!). Giusto? at the end of a sentence asks for a yes, like right? in English.",
