    "unit_id": "U44",
    "rule": "The tens are trenta, quaranta, cinquanta, sessanta, settanta, ottanta, novanta, then cento (100) and mille (1,000). In between, the tens and units join into one word: trentadue, quarantacinque. Before uno and otto the tens drop their last vowel: ventuno, trentotto.",
