  {
    "unit_id": "U71",
    "rule": "Words that join: ma (but), o and oppure (or), se (if), senza (without), tra and fra (between, or in, for time). Di, a, da, in and su join the article: di + il is del, in + la is nella, da + il is dal. Del caffè means some coffee.",
